 good\">LG</a></td> <td class=\"alignment-on\"><a href=\"/wiki/Neutral_good\" title=\"Neutral good\">NG</a></td> <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chaotic_good\" title=\"Chaotic good\">CG</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lawful_neutral\" title=\"Lawful neutral\">LN</a></td> <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Neutral\" title=\"Neutral\">N</a></td> <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chaotic_neutral\" title=\"Chaotic neutral\">CN</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lawful_evil\" title=\"Lawful evil\">LE</a></td> <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Neutral_evil\" title=\"Neutral evil\">NE</a></td> <td class=\"alignment-on\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chaotic_evil\" title=\"Chaotic evil\">CE</a></td> </tr></tbody></table><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-UE-127_2-6\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-127-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">400<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p135_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p135-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479 DR</a><br/>8,820<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-UE-127_2-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-127-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTG9yZF9VdGhsYWluP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Lord Uthlain (page does not exist)\">Lord Uthlain</span><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-UE-127_2-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-127-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SW5oYWJpdGFudHNfb2ZfVXRobWVyZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Uthmere (page does not exist)\">Inhabitants of  Uthmere</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Uthmere\" title=\"Category:Locations in Uthmere\">Locations in  Uthmere</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a class=\"newcategory\" href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Uthmere\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Uthmere\">Organizations in  Uthmere</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>Formerly a port town, the walled village of <b>Uthmere</b> was left high and dry when the <a href=\"/wiki/Sea_of_Fallen_Stars\" title=\"Sea of Fallen Stars\">Sea of Fallen Stars</a> receded following the <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a>.  As of <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479 DR</a> the village functioned primarily as a trading post.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p135_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p135-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_locations\">Notable locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\